<title>UK: CRICKET-DERBYSHIRE 49-1 AT LUNCH V AUSTRALIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-DERBYSHIRE 49-1 AT LUNCH V AUSTRALIA.</headline>
<dateline>DERBY, England 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Derbyshire, requiring 371 to win, were 49 for one wicket in their second innings at lunch, on the third and final day of their match against Australia on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 362-6 declared and 265-4 declared, Derbyshire 257-9 declared and 49-1.</p>
